{
  "id": "02-the-weight",
  "name": "The Weight",
  "format_version": 1,
  "seed": 1002,

  // Teaches: grab, drag, pressure plate, door.
  //
  // The plate is at the bottom of a pit and the door does not latch, so the
  // blob has to be left there. Both details are the level arguing with an
  // earlier draft of itself: with a latching door the player just dragged
  // the blob through the open doorway and never let go, and with the plate
  // flat on the floor the player shoved the blob off it on the way past.
  //
  // The plate ignores the player's own weight, so standing on it is not an
  // answer either. The only thing heavy enough is the blob, which is the
  // one sentence this level exists to say.

